\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"77123380\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Stainless Steel Pipe Screw Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231732587466099.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>This 4 Inch Stainless Steel Pipe Screw Pump is made of several pump---the pumpend, the motor body, outlet and so on. And the casing of this pump is made of stainless steel ONLY. The pump is upon the motor and divided into a single screw and pump pipe.</p><p><strong>1. Product Description</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Model</strong></p></td><td width=\"81\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Head(m)</strong></p></td><td width=\"85\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Q max(m³/h)</strong></p></td><td width=\"84\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Power(hp)</strong></p></td><td width=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Voltage(v)</strong></p></td><td width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Temperature(</strong><strong>℃</strong><strong>)</strong></p></td><td width=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Impeller</strong><br/>  <strong>Material</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">EGDa</p></td><td width=\"81\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">80/130</p></td><td width=\"85\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1.8/2.5</p></td><td width=\"84\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">05/0.67/1</p></td><td width=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220/380v</p></td><td width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">up to 35Cº</p></td><td width=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Iron+ Rubber</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Brand</strong></p></td><td width=\"81\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Length (mm)</strong></p></td><td width=\"85\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Casing Material</strong></p></td><td width=\"84\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Power(kW)</strong></p></td><td width=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Outlet</strong></p></td><td width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Frequency</strong></p></td><td width=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Speed</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td><td width=\"81\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">530/550/608</p></td><td width=\"85\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless steel</p></td><td width=\"84\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.37/0.5/0.75</p></td><td width=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">G1&amp;rdquo;</p></td><td width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">50Hz</p></td><td width=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850r/min</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231734485862008.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231732533589611.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231734549266742.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Application</strong></p><p>For pumping clean liquids without abrasive particles </p><p>For water supply from wells </p><p>For civil use</p><p>For domestic water use</p><p>For garden and farm irrigation</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231734565251945.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5.Operating Conditions</strong></p><p>Maximum fluid temperature up to +35Cº</p><p>Maximum sand content: 0.25%</p><p>Maximum immersion: 45m</p><p>Minimum well diameter: 4\"</p><p><strong>6. Company Information</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231735006026721.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p>As a professional pump maker in Wenling, where the pump manufacturing market is fierce, JIADI Pump Industry still has become one of the best without doubt. In JIADI, we are able to offer you the best service and products to an extreme. We sell various kinds of pumps including screw pump, multistage pump and so on. The size of these pumps ranges from 2” to 6”. We will spare no efforts to meet your requirements as long as we are able to offer. </p><p><strong>7. Why Choose Us</strong></p><p>1. 100% products will be carefully examined before packing</p><p>2. All the pumps are made of superior material and by professional teams and workers</p><p>3. Customized design is available. (We can print or label your logo on the product or package)</p><p>4. Any question will be earnestly answered within 24 hours.</p><p>5. We will try our best to provide you with right pump you need.</p><p><strong>8. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p><strong>Packing details: </strong></p><p>·One box contains one piece</p><p>·Carton or wooden box could be chosen</p><p>·Other requirements acceptable </p><p><strong>Delivery details:</strong></p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF)</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: 20-30 days</p><p><strong>Other: </strong></p><p>Payment terms: L/C, D/A, D/P, T/T, Western Union, Money Gram, PayPal</p><p>Supply Capability: 100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231735058146545.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>9. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What information shall I provide you when I need your offer?</strong></p><p>A: Normally, please send me your flow, total head, medium, medium temperature, pump material, voltage, frequency, etc so that we can quote you exactly what you need.</p><p><strong>2. Q: How about the warranty of the products?</strong></p><p>A: We offer customers one year of each product. During this period, we will offer free spare parts for replace. </p><p><strong>3. Q: Do I need to put a check valve in the pipe down to my pump?</strong></p><p>A: Most 4” submersible well pumps are equipped with a check valve in the discharge of the pump. Add an additional check valve for every 100’ or so of drop pipe you use. This can help to break up the water column so that one check valve does not have to hold all the weight of the water.</p><p><strong>4. Q: Is customized service available?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, OEM&amp;ODM is available.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch stainless steel pipe screw pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch/5-inch-motor-built-in-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"5 Inch Motor Built-in Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch48054138936a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch/5-inch-motor-built-in-submersible-pump\">5 Inch Motor Built-in Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/submersible-motor/3-inch-ac-electric-submersible-motor\"><img alt=\"3 Inch AC Electric Submersible Motor\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-electric-submersible-motor16506424368a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/submersible-motor/3-inch-ac-electric-submersible-motor\">3 Inch AC Electric Submersible Motor</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump/jiadi-stainless-steel-self-suction-screw-pump\"><img alt=\"JIADI Stainless Steel Self-Suction Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/cast-iron-self-suction-screw-pump23527749537a